Admin pages
    certifications with generated phrase asked the announcer to write on a paper and show in a photo
    can create admins -> provide an email, the system will send an email to the user with a link to activate the account
    can deactivate a certification
    can create/modify regions (can't delete regions if there is someone in it)
    can create/modify services
    can deactivate a user
    can see messages sent by users
    can see messages sent by admins
    can modify legal texts
        history of the legal texts
    Notifications sent when a user requires a certification
    Notifications sent when a user registers with a date birth that makes this person under 18 years old -> send a message to the local authorities

Super Admin
    all admin rights
    can see all the payments
    can modify tarifications
    can see all the events in the AdminAuditLog page
        can filter by admin, date, type of event, reason (if looking for empty reasons or specific reasons)
    can add/remove users and admins

Workers
    can see their payments
    can see their tarifications
    can report a client phone number that behaved badly -> send a message to the local authorities / admins
        create a application for announcers that prevents them when a reported client is calling them

Automated certifications expiration
    possibly inside an expiration table sorted by date. Re-activate the script when reaching the expiration date.

